    description: "Review all WARN and FAIL verdicts from the revalidation session. For each repo:\n\n1. Is it a known gap? (e.g., formal methods languages with structural analyzer limitations\n   tracked in WI-juviz, WI-kujuf, WI-zijos) → Document as known gap, no new item needed.\n2. Is it a regression? (was GOOD in initial run, now WARN) → Create todo_hard tracker item.\n3. Is it a new fix opportunity? (was WARN before, still WARN, but the diagnose report\n   points to a specific fixable issue) → Create todo_hard or todo_soft tracker item\n   depending on severity.\n4. Is it a \"close enough\" case? (metrics improved but didn't cross GOOD threshold) →\n   Note in lab notebook, no item needed unless there's a clear low-hanging fix.\n\nAlso review the LLM reflect improvement_ideas from item 9. Group them by theme and\nfrequency. Create tracker items for recurring themes that appear in 3+ repos.\n\nRecord all triage decisions in the lab notebook entry (item 12)."  # c0e2
